        <mxCell id="boundary" value="Persist the manifest before receipt. Suppress duplicate batch/item effects. Resume decomposition after a restart.&#10;Each client needs current access, authority and evidence. One blocked client cannot fail or disclose another.&#10;Correct or cancel only authorised items. Preserve completed work and invoice origins; hide inaccessible current progress.&#10;Unresolved effects keep cancellation incomplete. Report the current item result; assignment is not resolution." style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
